ithub.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":118102497,"digest":"sha256:7d754cf686a07f8c6782544a7d1e9a9e01a00a698757acb3bf6085fc9c6d35d1","download_count":15,"created_at":"2026-05-14T20:29:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T20:31:37Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.4.3/Advancely-v1.4.3-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.4.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.4.3","body":" ## The most notable additions/features of this update include, but are not limited to:\r\n\r\n### Coop player faces\r\n  - Skin-face fetch pipeline (Mojang API + on-disk cache (`resources\\cache` Folder), Notch fallback for offline/unavailable).\r\n  - Faces shown in Account tab, coop lobby, and the Player Dropdown.\r\n  - Per-goal contributor faces: simple advancements (first completer), complex advancements (current leader), simple stats and sub-stats (highest-value), manual checkboxes (single completer, hidden if multi), custom goals (counter contributor + manual completer, separate dimensions for goal == -1).\r\n  - Per-user settings: master Show Contributor Faces toggle, corner, face size, and a face-LOD threshold.\r\n \r\n ### Coop networking fixes\r\n  - Disconnect bug when waiting too long after join request.\r\n  - Improved / more user-facing disconnect error messages.\r\n  - Wrong room code now surfaces an error.\r\n\r\n ### Templates / content\r\n  - \"Uh Oh\" advancement added to both 26.2 templates.\r\n  - AATool-optimized layout promoted to the new default; default notes file renamed accordingly.\r\n\r\n ### UI / quality-of-life\r\n  - New font file `MSYHBD.TTC` plus `.ttc` support in the font import window.\r\n  - Configurable progress separator character for fonts without the default pipe.\r\n  - Hotkeys: key-capture input, labels added, hotkeys blocked when goal is completed, fixed unsaved-changes bug, and -1 custom goals retain their progress when toggled.\r\n  - `Manual Layout` tooltip improved; clarified that Windows overlay capture needs game-capture mode. `Edit Templates` renamed to `Open Template Editor`.\r\n  - Overlay width now saves properly.\r\n  - First-time pan/zoom defaults adjusted.\r\n  - Welcome window: supporter / donation message added.\r\n  - Sub-stat progress text is now its own positionable element in the visual layout editor.\r\n\r\n ### Visual assets\r\n  - Blackstone slabs icon texture added.\r\n\r\n ### Platform / packaging\r\n  - Linux folders no longer open twice.\r\n  - Fixed certification path for Linux installers.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}